# Spacing tokens

This project overrides Tailwind spacing in `app/globals.css`. `h-9`, `p-8`, `gap-7`, and similar utilities are **not** the default Tailwind sizes.

| Token | This project | Default Tailwind |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `1`–`4` | 4 / 8 / 12 / 16px | same |
| `5` | 24px | 20px |
| `6` | 32px | 24px |
| `7` | 48px | 28px |
| `8` | 64px | 32px |
| `9` | 96px | 36px |

Control heights match `Button`: `sm` is `h-5` (24px), `md` is `h-6` (32px). Never use `h-9` for a tab, button, or input (96px here).

```tsx
// BAD: default Tailwind muscle memory → 96px here
<Tabs.Tab className="h-9 px-3" />

// GOOD: same height as Button md
<Tabs.Tab className="h-6 px-3" />
```
